{
  "data.writeText": {
    "notes": "幂等写（idempotent-write）。`text` 与 `lines` 是 manifest 的 oneOf（二选一，由 orchestrator 的 Draft202012Validator 校验）——执行器层只判「有没有 text」，两者同时给时取 text；本表固化这一实现分支，不假装执行器会拒绝（S1 的口径：schema 校验不是执行器层的责任，执行器层的责任是失败要显式、错误码要可诊断）。`workspace`+`path` 用输出里的绝对路径与磁盘内容双证：只断言 outputs 的话，「写到别处去了」也会绿。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "text-branch-writes-exact-content",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "out/a.txt",
          "text": "你好\n世界"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputPaths": {
            "path": "{tmp}/ws/out/a.txt"
          },
          "effect": "idempotent-write",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/out/a.txt",
              "equals": "你好\n世界"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "lines-branch-joins-with-newline",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "out/b.txt",
          "lines": [
            "第一行",
            "第二行"
          ]
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputPaths": {
            "path": "{tmp}/ws/out/b.txt"
          },
          "effect": "idempotent-write",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/out/b.txt",
              "equals": "第一行\n第二行"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "relative-path-normalizes-within-workspace",
        "notes": "相对路径先与 workspace 拼接再 resolve：`sub/../ok.txt` 仍落在 workspace 内 → 允许（同一条规则的反面见下一条：`..` 一旦越出 workspace 就被拒）。",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "sub/../ok.txt",
          "text": "N"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputPaths": {
            "path": "{tmp}/ws/ok.txt"
          },
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/ok.txt",
              "equals": "N"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "text-and-lines-both-given-executor-takes-text",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "out/c.txt",
          "text": "T",
          "lines": [
            "L"
          ]
        },
        "expect": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/out/c.txt",
              "equals": "T"
            }
          ]
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "absolute-path-outside-workspace-is-denied",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "{tmp}/escape.txt",
          "text": "x"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "CAPABILITY_DENIED",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "escape.txt",
              "missing": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "relative-parent-escape-out-of-workspace-is-denied",
        "notes": "相对路径里的 `..` 只要越出 workspace 就被拒——即使它还在临时目录内（实测固化：判据是**相对于 workspace**，不是相对于磁盘根）。",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "../escape.txt",
          "text": "x"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "CAPABILITY_DENIED",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "escape.txt",
              "missing": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "data.appendText": {
    "notes": "追加写（unsafe-write，非幂等——重放会重复追加，这正是它的语义）。追加内容**不带**前导换行：`lines` 只是用 `\\n` 连接，与 `text` 同样直接拼在文件末尾（实测固化，避免后人「以为会自动加行尾」）。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "appends-text-to-existing-file",
        "setup": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/note.txt",
              "text": "原始"
            }
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "note.txt",
          "text": "-追加"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputPaths": {
            "path": "{tmp}/ws/note.txt"
          },
          "effect": "unsafe-write",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/note.txt",
              "equals": "原始-追加"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "lines-branch-appends-joined-lines",
        "setup": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/note.txt",
              "text": "原始"
            }
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "note.txt",
          "lines": [
            "-L1",
            "-L2"
          ]
        },
        "expect": {
          "effect": "unsafe-write",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/note.txt",
              "equals": "原始-L1\n-L2"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "creates-file-and-missing-parent-directories",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "deep/nested/x.txt",
          "text": "d"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputPaths": {
            "path": "{tmp}/ws/deep/nested/x.txt"
          },
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/deep/nested/x.txt",
              "equals": "d"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "absolute-path-outside-workspace-is-denied",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "{tmp}/escape.txt",
          "text": "x"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "CAPABILITY_DENIED",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "escape.txt",
              "missing": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "data.readText": {
    "notes": "读取（read effect）。两条被固化的边界：①**文件不存在与「路径是目录」都报 INVALID_INPUT**（不是 SCRIPT_FAILED，也不是静默空串）——报错文案是 `File not found: <绝对路径>`，带上解析后的路径，用户能立刻看出 workspace 拼到哪去了；②`path` 是相对路径时按 workspace 解析。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "reads-existing-utf8-file",
        "setup": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/note.txt",
              "text": "内容\n第二行"
            }
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "note.txt"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "text": "内容\n第二行"
          },
          "outputPaths": {
            "path": "{tmp}/ws/note.txt"
          },
          "outputKeys": [
            "text",
            "path"
          ],
          "effect": "read"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "relative-path-resolves-against-workspace",
        "setup": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/sub/x.txt",
              "text": "S"
            }
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "sub/x.txt"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "text": "S"
          },
          "outputPaths": {
            "path": "{tmp}/ws/sub/x.txt"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-file-is-invalid-input",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "nope.txt"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "INVALID_INPUT"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "directory-is-not-a-file",
        "setup": {
          "dirs": [
            "ws/dir"
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "dir"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "INVALID_INPUT"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "absolute-path-outside-workspace-is-denied",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "{tmp}/escape.txt"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "CAPABILITY_DENIED"
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "data.fileExists": {
    "notes": "存在性（read effect）。**路径不存在不是失败**：`exists=false` + 成功返回，调用方按值分支（这决定了下游 if 节点的写法）。目录算「存在」（用 Path.exists 而非 is_file）。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "existing-file-reports-true",
        "setup": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/note.txt",
              "text": "x"
            }
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "note.txt"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "exists": true
          },
          "outputPaths": {
            "path": "{tmp}/ws/note.txt"
          },
          "effect": "read"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-path-is-false-not-an-error",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "nope.txt"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "exists": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "directory-counts-as-existing",
        "setup": {
          "dirs": [
            "ws/dir"
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "dir"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "exists": true
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "absolute-path-outside-workspace-is-denied",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "{tmp}/escape.txt"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "CAPABILITY_DENIED"
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "data.deletePath": {
    "notes": "删除（unsafe-write）。两个边界必须钉住：①**删不存在的路径是成功 + `deleted=false`**（幂等友好，不报错）；②`recursive=false` 删非空目录会失败（INVALID_INPUT），且**目录与其中的文件必须原样还在**——所以这条负路径同时断言磁盘未变，否则「报错了但已经删了一半」会漏过。③报错文案来自 OS（WinError 145），跨平台不同，故只断言错误码。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "deletes-file-and-reports-true",
        "setup": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/victim.txt",
              "text": "bye"
            }
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "victim.txt"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "deleted": true
          },
          "effect": "unsafe-write",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/victim.txt",
              "missing": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "empty-directory-deletes-without-recursive",
        "setup": {
          "dirs": [
            "ws/empty"
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "empty",
          "recursive": false
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "deleted": true
          },
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/empty",
              "missing": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "nonempty-directory-without-recursive-fails-and-keeps-everything",
        "setup": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/tree/inner/x.txt",
              "text": "x"
            }
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "tree",
          "recursive": false
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "INVALID_INPUT",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/tree/inner/x.txt",
              "equals": "x"
            }
          ]
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "nonempty-directory-with-recursive-deletes",
        "setup": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/tree/inner/x.txt",
              "text": "x"
            }
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "tree",
          "recursive": true
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "deleted": true
          },
          "effect": "unsafe-write",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/tree/inner/x.txt",
              "missing": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-path-reports-not-deleted",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "ghost"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "deleted": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "absolute-path-outside-workspace-is-denied",
        "setup": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "keep.txt",
              "text": "keep"
            }
          ]
        },
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "{tmp}/keep.txt"
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "CAPABILITY_DENIED",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "keep.txt",
              "equals": "keep"
            }
          ]
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "data.writeJson": {
    "notes": "幂等写（indent=2、`ensure_ascii=false`、**末尾无换行**——实测固化，避免后人「顺手」加换行改变文件指纹）。写标量与 null 也是合法输入（`data` 在 schema 里没有类型约束）。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "writes-object-with-indent-and-unicode",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "out/d.json",
          "data": {
            "名称": "值",
            "nested": {
              "list": [
                1,
                2
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputPaths": {
            "path": "{tmp}/ws/out/d.json"
          },
          "effect": "idempotent-write",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/out/d.json",
              "jsonContains": {
                "名称": "值",
                "nested": {
                  "list": [
                    1,
                    2
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "scalar-value-is-written-as-json-literal",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "out/e.json",
          "data": "plain"
        },
        "expect": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/out/e.json",
              "equals": "\"plain\""
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "null-data-is-written-as-null",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "out/f.json",
          "data": null
        },
        "expect": {
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "ws/out/f.json",
              "equals": "null"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "absolute-path-outside-workspace-is-denied",
        "inputs": {
          "workspace": "{tmp}/ws",
          "path": "{tmp}/escape.json",
          "data": {}
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "CAPABILITY_DENIED",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "escape.json",
              "missing": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "data.format": {
    "notes": "模板渲染（pure）。非字符串值按 **JSON 序列化**后嵌入（`[1, 2]`、`{\"k\": \"v\"}`——注意带空格，这是 json.dumps 的默认分隔符）；模板里**没出现的** values 键被忽略（不报错）；**模板里有、values 里没有**的占位符报 INVALID_INPUT 并在 `details.missing` 里给出键名（可诊断性）——details 是本表唯一断言到 `errorDetails` 的地方。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "substitutes-values-and-json-encodes-non-strings",
        "inputs": {
          "template": "值={n} 列表={items} 文本={s}",
          "values": {
            "n": 3,
            "items": [
              1,
              2
            ],
            "s": "x"
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "text": "值=3 列表=[1, 2] 文本=x"
          },
          "noEffects": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "repeats-placeholder-and-ignores-unused-values",
        "inputs": {
          "template": "{a}-{a}-{a}",
          "values": {
            "a": "重复",
            "unused": 1
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "text": "重复-重复-重复"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "template-without-placeholder-passes-through",
        "inputs": {
          "template": "原样输出",
          "values": {}
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "text": "原样输出"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "nested-object-is-json-encoded",
        "inputs": {
          "template": "{obj}",
          "values": {
            "obj": {
              "k": "v"
            }
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "text": "{\"k\": \"v\"}"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-placeholder-is-invalid-input-with-details",
        "inputs": {
          "template": "{a}+{b}+{c}",
          "values": {
            "a": 1
          }
        },
        "expect": {
          "errorCode": "INVALID_INPUT",
          "errorDetails": {
            "missing": [
              "b",
              "c"
            ]
          }
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "data.limit": {
    "notes": "截断（pure）。`count` 超过长度按长度截断（不报错）；`count=0`（schema 下界）给空数组。**边界固化**：`items` 不是数组时执行器不做 schema 校验——`list(\"abc\")[:2]` 会给出 `[\"a\", \"b\"]`（按字符拆）。这条**不是缺陷**，是「schema 由 orchestrator 的 Draft202012Validator 统一拦」的直接证据（S1 的口径修正），写在这里免得后人当成 bug 去「修」。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "takes-first-count-items",
        "inputs": {
          "items": [
            1,
            2,
            3,
            4
          ],
          "count": 2
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "items": [
              1,
              2
            ],
            "count": 2
          },
          "noEffects": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "count-beyond-length-clamps-to-length",
        "inputs": {
          "items": [
            1,
            2
          ],
          "count": 5
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "items": [
              1,
              2
            ],
            "count": 2
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "count-zero-returns-empty-list",
        "inputs": {
          "items": [
            1,
            2
          ],
          "count": 0
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "items": [],
            "count": 0
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "empty-list-stays-empty",
        "inputs": {
          "items": [],
          "count": 3
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "items": [],
            "count": 0
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "non-array-items-are-not-validated-at-executor-level",
        "inputs": {
          "items": "abc",
          "count": 2
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "items": [
              "a",
              "b"
            ],
            "count": 2
          }
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "data.log": {
    "notes": "打印日志（pure）：**纯透传**——`message` 的 `${}` / fx 标签解析发生在 orchestrator（规则：handler 不改 scopes），worker 只回传最终文本。`level` 缺省 `info`；枚举（info/warn/error）**不在执行器层校验**，未知值原样透传（同 data.limit 的说明）。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "defaults-to-info-level",
        "inputs": {
          "message": "普通日志"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "message": "普通日志",
            "level": "info"
          },
          "noEffects": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "warn-level-passes-through",
        "inputs": {
          "message": "警告",
          "level": "warn"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "level": "warn"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "error-level-passes-through",
        "inputs": {
          "message": "错误",
          "level": "error"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "level": "error"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "empty-message-is-allowed",
        "inputs": {
          "message": "",
          "level": "info"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "message": "",
            "level": "info"
          }
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown-level-is-not-validated-at-executor-level",
        "inputs": {
          "message": "x",
          "level": "INFO"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "level": "INFO"
          }
        },
        "negative": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "data.setVar": {
    "notes": "变量赋值（pure）——worker 只按 `varType` 把值格式化成目标类型并回传 `varName`/`value`；**真正写进 scopes 由 orchestrator 按 manifest `x-var-write` 完成**（规则 3：handler 不改 scopes）。类型格式化规则逐条固化（对标影刀「设置变量」）：空值给该类型默认值（`\"\"`/0/false/`{}`/`[]`）、number 认布尔与数字串、boolean 认 `true/1/yes`（大小写不敏感，其余为 false）、object/array 认 JSON 串且**类型must相符**。varType 五个枚举取值全覆盖。",
